        "alt": "The ticket fills the frame with one line of text and empty lines; below it, the teams’ log boxes stay closed."
      }
    },
    "agents-go-and-look-text-22": {
      "id": "agents-go-and-look-text-22",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "p-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Triangle works the way a group of on-call engineers does, with one agent per role and one per team:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "list-14",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "li-15",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-16",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Analyzer: semantic distillation.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " It aligns the incident’s wording with the teams’ functional documents and extracts key phrases for the failure’s location, its symptoms and the capabilities needed to fix it."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "li-17",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-18",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Decider: candidate teams.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " It combines the teams that handled the most similar past incidents with the teams whose compressed documents match best, and ranks them into a shortlist."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "li-19",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-20",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Team Manager agents: enrichment and vote.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " Each shortlisted team’s agent queries its own monitoring data, adds an enriched discussion to the incident and votes. A majority assigns the incident; without one, the Decider drops those teams and shortlists new ones, for at most five rounds."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a team’s responsibilities change, only its functional document needs updating: its agent reads the new version."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
    "agents-go-and-look-image-24": {
      "id": "agents-go-and-look-image-24",
