    "fewer-hops-sooner-text-52": {
      "id": "fewer-hops-sooner-text-52",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "table-25",
          "type": "table",
          "headerRows": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "tr-26",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "td-27",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Measure"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-28",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Triangle"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-29",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Best other"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tr-30",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "td-31",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Right team, first hop"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-32",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "54.7%",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-33",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "DeepCT 43.4%"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tr-34",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "td-35",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Right team within five hops"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-36",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "91.7%",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-37",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "DeepCT 67.6%"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "tr-38",
              "type": "tableRow",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "td-39",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Bug triage, MSR 2013"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-40",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "63.2%",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "td-41",
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "LGBM 54.8%"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hop accuracy is measured on three months of production incidents (Table II); DeepCT is given the discussions engineers wrote, while Triangle writes its own. The bug-triage row uses 200 cases of the MSR 2013 dataset (Table IV). In production, across six services, triage accuracy is 64–97% and Time to Engage is 18–91% shorter than in the three months before deployment (Table I). Triangle runs on about 600 million logs and more than 20 TB of data a day, across over 2,000 fault types. What drives the accuracy:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "list-43",
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "li-44",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-45",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Team Information Enrichment matters most: without it, accuracy within five hops falls from 91.7% to 65.8% (Table III)."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "li-46",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-47",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Negotiation matters at the first hop: when the Decider assigns from its ranking alone, accuracy falls from 54.7% to 42.8%."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "li-48",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-49",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The gap to DeepCT widens with every hop: 11.3 points at the first, 24.1 at the fifth."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "li-50",
              "type": "listItem",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "p-51",
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Accuracy is lowest where tickets are generated from templates with little context: 64% for service D."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "only": [
        "web"
      ]
    },
